**S10.1 — Scorecard Feedback Widget**

Three files changed:

1. **`civicstat-web/components/ScorecardFeedback.tsx`** (new) — Client component with three states:
   - `idle`: Shows a "Klopt dit niet? Geef feedback" link
   - `form`: Inline textarea form (expands in-place, no modal)
   - `submitted`: Confirmation message
