   - Validates the payload
   - Forwards to `FEEDBACK_WEBHOOK_URL` env var if set (Slack-compatible JSON)
   - Falls back to `console.log` if no webhook configured

3. **`civicstat-web/app/partijen/[id]/page.tsx`** — Added `ScorecardFeedback` button alongside the `MethodologyLink` at the bottom of the scorecard card, passing `partyId`, `partyAbbreviation`, and `electionYear` as context.

No new DB tables or migrations needed. To activate webhook delivery, set `FEEDBACK_WEBHOOK_URL` in Vercel env vars.
